{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで舞台に関する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいお知らせ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私 若月佑美が 黒主優姫役をやらせて頂いております、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台 ヴァンパイア騎士-Revive-の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"追加公演が決定いたしました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/06/04/8774645/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月02日の公演予定が 19時からの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜公演のみでしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"追加公演決定により、14時からの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼公演も上演する事になりました(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"追加公演決定出来たのも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが来てくださるおかげです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台というのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てくださる方がいて初めて作品として成り立つものだと私は思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、こうして 沢山の方が観に来てくださる事が何よりも有難いことなのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様もし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お時間がありましたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足を運んで頂けたら嬉しいですっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳細はこちら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nelke.co.jp/stage/vk02/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、お稽古始まっておりますので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お写真載せますヽ(*´∀｀)八(´∀｀*)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊風紀委員復活＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩から優姫。そこっ！座敷童じゃないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/06/04/8774645/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩から零。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この方は完全に血を吸いにきてますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/06/04/8774645/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰一人カメラを見ないあたり。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/06/04/8774645/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在、先取りで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枢様、零、理事長、優姫が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古開始しております！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の再会を楽しみながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのものを更に良くしていこうと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張っております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しく架院暁役に入ってくださる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綾那さんにも一瞬でしたがお会いして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご挨拶出来てよかったです＊なにより"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お写真でも感じてはいたのだけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ美人様でびっくり( ºωº≡ºωº )！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また違う架院先輩わくわく！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今お稽古では役の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちをもっと深く考えたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原作をもっと読み込んだり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再演だからこそやれることを頑張ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなめちゃめちゃ仲良しで楽しいチームなのでそれが皆さんに良い空気感として"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝わると良いなヽ(*´∀｀)八(´∀｀*)ノ❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台 ヴァンパイア騎士-Revive-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援よろしくお願いしますっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、また。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/06/04/8774645/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}